{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32653","headline":"从郑郎中高州游东潭 · 刘沧","name":"从郑郎中高州游东潭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟岚晚入湿旌旗，高槛风清醉未归。\n夹路野花迎马首，出林山鸟向人飞。\n一谿寒水涵清浅，几处晴云度翠微。\n自是谢公心近得，登楼望月思依依。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}